  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Review Learning Synthesis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solutions Hub Programme in the Centre for delivery in the FCDO is a multi-year Official Development Assistance (ODA) programme running from April 2023 to April 2026 with &#xA3;660,000 funding included in the Business Case. The programme funding will be used in conjunction with the core FCDO team working in the Solutions Hub to support the team with their work. The funding will provide quality research and analysis that draws out lessons and best practice to support improvements to programme design, delivery, and review, as well as strengthening the evidence and resource base for FCDO colleagues and externally, with the aim of streamlining the process of programme design.  It will also help colleagues screen out ineffective approaches and practices, providing constructive challenge to optimism bias and unnecessary complexity, and supporting greater agility in programmes to identify and respond to risk and opportunities, or to test, learn and adapt through delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
